{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_wildmn_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_wildmn_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"憧憬","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_wildmn_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"b4ddb4bcf020a2b174692b375bcb46910425e18fa261884390ad26efa4bebfad","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“艾沃娜，你的理想是什麼呀？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聽聞艾沃娜的回答，父母滿意地笑了起來。來做客的叔叔高興地摸了摸小艾沃娜的頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"名單上的感染者就差最後一個沒聯繫了？這麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然，我的速度你還不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有其他要聯繫的人嗎？都包在我身上好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"讓我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"今天沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"聯繫上這位卡利什先生之後，你就可以放一下午的假啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放假？我不需要放假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"艾沃娜，你應該好好休息一下了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，那是......征戰騎士？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不遠處的書報亭前站著一位征戰騎士，看見他的艾沃娜自然而然地停下腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"書報亭老闆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這一款......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不是......哪個......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"看著征戰騎士似乎陷入了什麼麻煩，艾沃娜並未多想，快步走上前去。\n她沒能在停電那一夜目睹銀槍天馬進城的場景，但在那之後鋪天蓋地的新聞和照片，仍然讓她心潮澎湃。\n對她而言，那無疑是一道劃破卡西米爾霓虹色夜空的閃電。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜，我有點事先掛了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"可你的假期——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，等聯繫上卡利什先生之後，我下午會好好休個假的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（冷靜，艾沃娜，冷靜。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，需要什麼幫助嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾沃娜看見，征戰騎士對著猶豫不決的東西，是兩張彩票。\n征戰騎士，彩票。\n這樣的組合她永遠都想不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾沃娜·克魯科夫斯卡，感染者競技騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉打擾，如果沒什麼要緊事我先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一等，你知道這兩種彩票——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對這些不熟......再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼堂堂征戰騎士會去買彩票？為什麼會對這種烏煙瘴氣的東西感興趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，不想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他大概只是好奇，因為沒見過，一定是這麼回事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看......卡利什先生的家是在這裡沒錯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利什先生？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利什","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......艾、艾沃娜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她要找的卡利什躺在自家門口，捂著腿上的傷口呻吟，血從他的指縫間湧出來。\n周圍空無一人，沒人敢上前來幫助這位受傷的感染者，原因顯而易見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是無胄盟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利什","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦地點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利什","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（指向巷子深處）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾沃娜替卡利什緊急包紮了傷口，隨即握緊了自己的騎槍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找他們算總帳——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"話剛說出口，她突然想到，把一個剛剛受過襲擊的感染者扔在這裡，這樣真的好嗎？\n以前的野鬃騎士不考慮這些，她只想握緊騎槍衝鋒，可現在不一樣。她是紅松騎士團的野鬃。\n但是，放任那些殺手溜走，會不會把自己和卡利什共同拖進危險——\n正在這時，她看到一個人正好從巷口經過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——聽得到嗎？喂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜·克魯......克魯科夫斯卡小姐？你有什麼事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人......是誰把他傷成這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是無胄盟，我正要去給他們一個教訓。這位卡利什先生拜託給你可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題——等等，他和你一樣是個感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我得注意點，不能碰他的血，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，給那群陰溝裡的蟲子一個教訓！卡利什就交給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你送卡利什先生去紅松騎士團的安全屋，他認得路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這張卡片上是紅松騎士團的徽記，到了那裡就把卡片給那裡的人看，他們會知道出了什麼事的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你無路可逃了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......很能跑啊，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們為什麼要對卡利什下手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，我也不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，我認出你來了，野鬃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我同事之前好像鬧得挺大，不過那不是我的事，跟我無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"但你應該改改這個暴脾氣，真的。我們又沒要那傢伙的命，你何苦來蹚渾水呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少廢話，看招！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"我承認我打不過你，但你本來也不在我的目標名單上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"都要走了，少給自己找點麻煩，不好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我們要離開？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可是公眾人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前，我還押過你幾次，結果賠得稀哩嘩啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在跟你算的是卡利什的帳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是上面的命令，你們濫殺無辜的時候，扣扳機的手指就不會抖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"我手指抖了，我好怕啊，小姐，所以能留我一命嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要你的命，我要你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給卡利什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道歉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那我也無話可說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能說，能遇到焰尾那一群人，你真的很幸運，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"要是和她們一起出來，你或許還能撿回一條命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無胄盟成員的力道稍減。\n艾沃娜在無數次搏殺中磨練出來的直覺告訴她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放冷箭的傢伙？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在哪裡？看我揪你出來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隱藏的無胄盟成員箭箭指向艾沃娜的要害，艾沃娜只能不斷地閃避。\n然後，她看到，剛剛被她逼到牆角的人也掏出了弓，瞄準了她的眼睛——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在陰影裡的蟲豸，滾出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"征戰騎士......先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們保衛卡西米爾，不是為了給你們提供腐敗的溫床！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無胄盟成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"征戰騎士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜，小心他們偷襲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意四周的動靜，我們趕緊離開這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯！征戰騎士先生把卡利什先生送來了，羅德島的醫生也在，不用擔心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":true,"text":"你最近也累壞了，好好享受這個下午吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問我該怎麼稱呼你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我馬索夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬索夫先生，真的，太謝謝你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要這麼客氣，我也只是休假時碰巧路過，就順手幫個忙罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰會喜歡無胄盟這種髒東西呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，說得好！沒人喜歡無胄盟這種髒東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，正好我今天下午也休假，我們找個地方喝一杯怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊！我請客！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這......好、好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，喝酒去，喝酒去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，酒吧難道不是越熱鬧越好嗎？你怎麼拉著我進了這家沒什麼人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......我喜歡清靜一點的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這家的酒也不錯。乾杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這酒確實不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬索夫老兄，你們征戰騎士進入大騎士領那一晚，我因為和無胄盟打架，沒在現場看到你們的身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是那之後的新聞報導，我一期不落地看了！真是太酷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大騎士領就需要你們這樣的人，把那些兩面三刀的傢伙臉上的面具扔到地上，再狠狠踩上兩腳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道商業聯合會那些人把我們感染者騎士看成什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看成什麼？難道不就是感染了礦石病的競技騎士嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，競技騎士對他們來說是提線木偶，而我們感染者騎士連木偶都算不上，完全就是一塊破抹布！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次騎士競技出了什麼亂子，他們永遠都能找到一個完全無關的感染者騎士，把責任一股腦推給他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到他們想吹噓自己對感染者不錯，我們就又被推到台前，當成“優待”的證明展覽給其他人......一想到這些，我肺都要氣炸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們怎麼能這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就說剛才那些無胄盟吧。自從我們紅松騎士團有了一些名聲，他們就沒少找上門來，就因為我們不願意被商業聯合會當成破抹布！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停電那晚，我差點被他們殺了，我的同伴也因為他們遭遇了生命危險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也聽說過不少無胄盟的傳聞，但他們敢在大騎士領這麼肆無忌憚，我今天也是頭一次見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為我們要幫助感染者，和他們對著幹，他們早就想把我們除掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們才不可能放棄。只要我還有一口氣，就不可能坐視大騎士領把感染者嚼碎吞掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......也沒這麼嚴重吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無胄盟和商業聯合會確實可恨，但你說整個大騎士領的話，至少卡西米爾的中樞還是願意保護感染者的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，他們也不會同意設立感染者騎士這種制度了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼說，好像也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，先不聊這個了，喝酒喝酒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，再來一杯威士忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"要加冰？還是蘇打水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"純飲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"給，你的威士忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......給我也來一杯一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"要加什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"純飲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，這東西純飲後勁很大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬索夫老兄，說起來，我剛剛在街上見到你的時候，你好像在看彩票？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我一句，那東西就是個無底洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜跟我說過，彩票都是設計好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"容易中獎的都只能中些小錢，號稱有大獎的幾乎沒人能中！還有那些押騎士競技勝負的，幾乎全都有人在背後操縱——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"胡......胡說八道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我表哥，上個月買、買了彩票，中了一大筆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這些都是少數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我......也經常押騎士競技的勝負，我也、也沒少贏錢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是索娜說過，彩票的發行商早都算好了，你們贏到手裡的錢是不可能比花出去買彩票的錢多的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"胡扯，完全是胡扯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我表哥本來病得很重了，他是靠那筆獎金才活下來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也只是特殊情況——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼特殊情況，我看你是找揍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你剛才說過吧，自己是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那又怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者就該、就該扔到大騎士領外面去，省得污染街道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再說一遍試試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，感染者還敢來撒野——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾沃娜一把抓起了醉漢的領子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再說一遍？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，得意什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的騎士真是越來越差勁了，先是同意感染者當競技騎士，現在連征戰騎士也和感染者混在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一直坐著的馬索夫騰地站了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你得為自己對征戰騎士的污衊負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉漢","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“先生，你得為自己對征戰騎士的污衊負責”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話太帥了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬索夫老兄，對付這種敗興的傢伙，還是你有經驗啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種人不識好歹，等他酒醒就知道怕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過就算被那傢伙攪了一通我也得說，彩票這東西最好別碰。那就是商業聯合會搞出來斂財的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你的勸告，我不會再想著買什麼彩票了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但彩票也不全是壞東西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你說說，彩票好在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像那種可悲的傢伙，至少能在裡面得到一點點希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......你說的有點......深奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為彩票之類的東西，自從我成為感染者騎士之後，總是有人想讓我打假賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壓力肯定很大吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實不小，但我從來就沒聽過他們的，啊哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贏就是贏，輸就是輸，我可不願意為了區區幾個錢就放棄勝利的榮耀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好。為了勝利的榮耀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了勝利的榮耀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，艾沃娜，你姓什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我隱約有點印象，似乎有其他隊伍裡的騎士和你的姓氏差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克魯科夫斯卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我家裡確實有征戰——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，接個電話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"馬索夫，不是說了在梅什科工業大樓下面集合嗎，你跑哪去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我處理點事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別支支吾吾了，我們都看見了，你進了一家酒吧，身邊還有一個人，看起來像個競技騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看不出來，你小子也學壞了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就去找你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電話那頭的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，不用勞動你，我們已經在酒館門外啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同伴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"馬索夫有些僵硬地站起來，朝門外走去。\n逆著陽光，艾沃娜看見，那裡站著三個征戰騎士，正等著馬索夫出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"馬索夫，你小子能耐不小啊。為了騙口酒喝，你都和競技騎士混到一起了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼騙酒喝，你們就喜歡瞎說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快出來吧，這種下等人扎堆的地方你也真進得去。那個競技騎士的酒沒讓你喝壞肚子就不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你看上人家了，打算和她......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"得了，你們少打趣他兩句吧。他肯定也是迫不得已，這才跟這種頂著騎士頭銜的渣滓混在一起的。你說呢，馬索夫？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"馬索夫窘迫地轉頭和艾沃娜對視了一眼。\n艾沃娜尚且震驚於那幾名征戰騎士的言論，無暇回應馬索夫求助的眼神。\n馬索夫於是回過頭去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少——少——少開這種沒輕沒重的玩笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，馬索夫來勁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰認識這傢伙啊，我是被她強拉來喝酒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個崇拜征戰騎士的小姑娘罷了，連正經騎士的邊都摸不到，誰和她混在一起了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是你們出來得晚，誰願意在這種破地方喝酒啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞎說，我剛才還看見你和她有說有笑呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就和她開開玩笑。競技騎士不就是用來給人解悶的傢伙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，出來再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馬索夫，你？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦喲，這是什麼？小卡片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，沒想到你這個看起來最老實的傢伙還有這一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該不會這就是你們兩個的秘密聯絡方式吧，放在火上一烤就能有字的那種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡扯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾沃娜看見，馬索夫把印著紅松騎士團標誌的卡片扔在地上，狠狠踏了上去，甚至還踩了好幾腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟你們說過了，就是開開玩笑，你們還不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種競技騎士，還是個感染者，我看上她？要不是她死纏爛打，我才不會來這種鬼地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，居然還是個感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"征戰騎士B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"馬索夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_624_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我們喝好酒去！這家店的酒難喝死了，沒有哪個體面人受得了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"征戰騎士們鬧哄哄地走遠了。\n艾沃娜在原地怔了一會。她此刻唯一能做的是把地上的卡片撿起來。\n卡片上，灰色的鞋印重重疊疊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就是......征戰騎士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾沃娜回想著這位征戰騎士從頭到尾的表現。\n到底哪一面才是真正的馬索夫？\n他願意為了感染者的安危挺身而出，願意和只有一面之緣的感染者競技騎士一同喝酒。\n他把象徵紅松騎士團的卡片踩在腳下，他撒謊說自己死纏爛打，他說競技騎士就是用來給人解悶的傢伙。\n他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"給，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......牧草伏特加？超大杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒點這種酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我這裡最好的酒，送你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那傢伙的事，你別往心裡去。騎士老爺嘛，都是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士......老爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"看你這樣子......算啦，你們這頓酒我請了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛不是還幫我趕走了一個耍酒瘋的嗎？就當是報酬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"敞開喝吧，這間酒吧不就是為了你我這樣的人開起來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒吧老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，一口氣喝光了一整杯酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼好的酒，不一口喝光怎麼行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天下午可是我難得的假期！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道該怎麼度過，但我可不能把假期給浪費了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"說好了下午放假的，你怎麼這麼早就回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（含混的嘟囔聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，原來是喝多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"和那位征戰騎士先生一起喝的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那你睡吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這麼快就睡著了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜酒量一直不錯的，只有心情不好的時候才容易醉。這次醉得這麼厲害，難道是鬧了什麼不愉快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咿——呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正......正......正義騎士號！集合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正義騎士號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嘀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（原來是夢話啊......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......前幾天......想把你，漆成，純銀的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正義騎士號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後改名叫、叫、叫，銀槍、天馬、正義、征戰——騎士號！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正義騎士號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嘀嘀？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我改主意了！你以後就......還是叫、正義騎士號、好了！漆也不用、不用刷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正義騎士號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"解散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"正義騎士號","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘀嘀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一張小小的卡片從艾沃娜口袋裡掉了出來，上面是紅松騎士團的標誌，還有一串鞋印。\n進來給艾沃娜蓋毛毯的索娜沒有遺漏這張卡片。\n看著卡片上重疊的陌生鞋印，再聯繫上剛剛的夢話，她大概能想像出艾沃娜為何會醉成這個樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"理想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）艾沃娜？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要成為光榮的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾沃娜翻了個身，不再講夢話，呼呼大睡起來。\n索娜歎了口氣，收起髒汙的卡片，把一張乾淨的卡片塞回艾沃娜的口袋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
